# Library Management System API
## Project Overview
The Library Management System API is a backend application
developed using NestJS, Prisma ORM, TypeScript, and PostgreSQL.

It manages library users, book genres, and book records.

The system supports two user roles:
- PATRON
- LIBRARIAN

## Technologies Used
- Node.js
- TypeScript
- NestJS
- Prisma ORM
- PostgreSQL

